</script></head><body class="body"><div data-collapse="medium" data-animation="default" data-duration="400" data-easing="ease" data-easing2="ease" role="banner" class="navigation navigation-2 w-nav"><div class="navigation-wrap"><div class="nav-left"><a href="/" class="logo-link logo-to-left desktop w-nav-brand"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61f2ac630563985ada1eebac/620d07f83ab5374b84c7b61d_DFoundation.svg" class="logo-image logo-to-left"/></a><div class="navigation-wrap logo-to-left"><nav role="navigation" class="navigation-items w-nav-menu"><a href="/vision-and-mission" class="navigation-item w-nav-link">Vision and mission</a><a href="/global-users" class="navigation-item w-nav-link">Global users</a><a href="/framework" aria-current="page" class="navigation-item w-nav-link w--current">DISARM Framework</a><a href="/about-us" class="navigation-item w-nav-link">About</a><a href="/support-us" class="navigation-item w-nav-link">Support us</a><a href="https://medium.com/disarming-disinformation" target="_blank" class="navigation-item w-nav-link">Blog</a><a data-w-id="52cf3268-f48f-b810-66f2-a60daeba508c" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdkn1fFfC_ZY9Tnvf6BkmKUizZFp33o9INXVPtPqmb5cl5unA/viewform?usp=sf_link" target="_blank" class="btn mod--nav mobile w-inline-block"><div class="btn__bg-wrap"><div class="btn__bg"></div></div><div class="btn__txt">Contact us</div></a><div data-delay="0" data-hover="true" class="dropdown hidden w-dropdown"><div class="dropdown-toggle-2 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icon-5 w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div><div class="text-block-12">Online shop</div></div><nav class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="collection-list-wrapper-nav w-dyn-list"><div class="w-dyn-empty"><div>No items found.</div></div></div></nav></div></nav><div class="menu-button w-nav-button"><img width="22" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61f2ac630563985ada1eebac/61f3bbe9ede2155368fb6078_menu-icon.png" alt="" class="menu-icon"/></div></div></div><a href="/" class="logo-link logo-to-left mobile w-nav-brand"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61f2ac630563985ada1eebac/620d07f83ab5374b84c7b61d_DFoundation.svg" class="logo-image logo-to-left"/></a><div class="nav-right"><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="w-dropdown"><nav class="w-dropdown-list"><a data-tab="profile" data-o-authenticated="1" data-o-profile="1" data-mode="popup" href="https://disarm-foundation.outseta.com/profile?#o-authenticated" class="account-options w-dropdown-link">Profile</a><a data-redirect="/" data-o-auth="1" data-o-anonymous="1" data-mode="popup" data-widget-mode="login" href="https://disarm-foundation.outseta.com/auth?widgetMode=login#o-anonymous" class="account-options w-dropdown-link">Sign-in</a><a class="w-dropdown-link" data-skip-plan-options="true" data-mode="popup" data-widget-mode="register" data-o-auth="1" href="https://disarm-foundation.outseta.com/auth?widgetMode=register&amp;planUid=dQGdOo94&amp;planPaymentTerm=month&amp;skipPlanOptions=true#o-anonymous" data-o-anonymous="1" data-plan-uid="dQGdOo94" data-redirect="/">Create an account</a><a data-o-logout-url="" data-o-logout-link="1" href="/#o-logout-link" class="w-dropdown-link">Logout</a></nav></div></div><div class="nav-right"><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="w-dropdown"><div class="dropdown-toggle-3 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="text-block-28">Account</div></div><nav class="w-dropdown-list"><a data-tab="profile" data-o-authenticated="1" data-o-profile="1" data-mode="popup" href="#" class="account-options w-dropdown-link">Profile</a><a data-redirect="/" data-o-auth="1" data-o-anonymous="1" data-mode="popup" data-widget-mode="login" href="#" class="account-options w-dropdown-link">Sign-in</a><a class="w-dropdown-link" data-skip-plan-options="true" data-mode="popup" data-widget-mode="register" data-o-auth="1" href="#" data-o-anonymous="1" data-plan-uid="dQGdOo94" data-redirect="/">Create an account</a><a data-o-logout-url="" data-o-logout-link="1" href="#" class="w-dropdown-link">Logout</a></nav></div></div><div class="nav-right"><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="w-dropdown"><nav class="w-dropdown-list"><a data-tab="profile" data-o-authenticated="1" data-o-profile="1" data-mode="popup" href="#" class="account-options w-dropdown-link">Profile</a><a data-redirect="/" data-o-auth="1" data-o-anonymous="1" data-mode="popup" data-widget-mode="login" href="#" class="account-options w-dropdown-link">Sign-in</a><a class="w-dropdown-link" data-skip-plan-options="true" data-mode="popup" data-widget-mode="register" data-o-auth="1" href="#" data-o-anonymous="1" data-plan-uid="dQGdOo94" data-redirect="/">Create an account</a><a data-o-logout-url="" data-o-logout-link="1" href="#" class="w-dropdown-link">Logout</a></nav></div><a data-w-id="15fe4842-3dbd-87b5-0483-befd4aa1c54c" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdkn1fFfC_ZY9Tnvf6BkmKUizZFp33o9INXVPtPqmb5cl5unA/viewform?usp=sf_link" target="_blank" class="btn mod--nav w-inline-block"><div class="btn__bg-wrap"><div class="btn__bg"></div></div><div class="btn__txt">Contact us</div></a></div></div></div><section></section><div class="section---text-content"><div class="block-760"><div data-account-activity="browsed to framework" class="rich-text-block-9 w-richtext"><h1>DISARM Red Framework<br/></h1><p><em>The DISARM Red Framework provides a common language for documenting influence operations. When different organisations describe what they&#x27;re seeing in the same terms, they can share intelligence, and gain a better understanding of actors&#x27; manipulative behaviours.</em></p><h2><em>‍</em>Using the Framework</h2><p>Anyone can use the DISARM Red Framework to document influence operations. The <a href="https://DISARMFoundation.github.io/disarm-navigator/">framework can be accessed here.</a> We offer standard certification training through partner organisations on a regional basis, and also provide bespoke training and consultancy options to help you make the best use of DISARM for your specific context and needs. For more information, in the first instance, email us at info@disarm.foundation.</p><h2>Framework Updates<br/></h2><p>The DISARM Red Framework is open-source, published under a <a href="https://github.com/DISARMFoundation/DISARMframeworks?tab=CC-BY-SA-4.0-1-ov-file#readme">CC-BY-SA-4.0 license</a>, and regularly updated based on community feedback. You can <a href="https://medium.com/tag/disarm-red-update">check out the latest improvements to the framework here.</a> If you would like to give us feedback on how the framework could be improved, please reach out via our contact page.</p><h2>Framework Roadmap</h2><p>We have begun work on a Prototype DISARM v2.0 - building on the lessons from version 1. This will deliver a more powerful and flexible framework, which better adapts to the wide variety of behaviours and objectives seen in influence operations, whilst improving speed, accuracy and analyst usability. </p><p>You can <a href="https://medium.com/disarming-disinformation/disarm-red-retrospective-and-futrospective-68854e51c5cf">read more about our plans for DISARM v2.0 here</a>, and access a <a href="https://DISARMFoundation.github.io/disarm-navigator-20-observable/">Prototype of the Observations element of DISARM v2.0 here.</a></p><h2>Tagged Reports</h2><p>DISARM&#x27;s Tagger Tool is an open-source Microsoft Word plugin which supports analysts in tagging reports. <a href="https://github.com/DISARMFoundation/DISARMWordPlugIn/raw/main/Install_Files/DISARM_Word_PlugIn.msi">Click here to download the plugin.</a></p><p>Each update to the Red Framework adds real-world examples of behaviours seen in third party reporting. Organisations are able to <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdkn1fFfC_ZY9Tnvf6BkmKUizZFp33o9INXVPtPqmb5cl5unA/viewform?usp=sf_link" target="_blank">contribute their own reporting to this growing database of influence operations.</a></p></div></div></div><footer id="footer" class="footer"><div class="section"><a href="/" class="footer-logo-link top-middle"></a><div class="divider-horizontal"></div><div class="footer-flex-container"><a href="/" class="footer-logo-link"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61f2ac630563985ada1eebac/620d07f7482d82cc91383e4a_DFoundation_On-dark.svg" alt="" class="footer-image"/></a><div class="empty-filler"></div><div class="footer-links-block"><ul role="list" class="list w-list-unstyled"><li><div class="div-block-12"><div class="text-block-14">Email:<br/></div><a href="mailto:info@disarm.foundation" class="email-link">info@disarm.foundation</a></div></li></ul></div><div class="footer-links-block"><h2 class="footer-heading">Navigation</h2><ul role="list" class="list w-list-unstyled"><li><a href="/" class="footer-link">Home</a></li><li><a href="/vision-and-mission" class="footer-link">Vision and mission</a></li><li><a href="/global-users" class="footer-link">Global users</a></li><li><a href="/framework" aria-current="page" class="footer-link w--current">DISARM Framework</a></li><li><a href="/about-us" class="footer-link">About us</a></li><li><a href="https://medium.com/disarming-disinformation" target="_blank" class="footer-link">Blog</a></li></ul></div><div class="footer-links-block hidden"><h2 class="footer-heading">JB note: <br/>no column<br/>needed here</h2><ul role="list" class="w-list-unstyled"><li><a href="#" class="footer-link">Text Link</a></li><li><a href="#" class="footer-link">Text Link</a></li></ul></div><div class="footer-links-block hidden"><h2 class="footer-heading">JB note: <br/>no column<br/>needed here</h2><ul role="list" class="w-list-unstyled"><li><a href="#" class="footer-link">Text Link</a></li><li><a href="#" class="footer-link">Text Link</a></li><li><a href="#" class="footer-link">Text Link</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="footer-bottom-line"><div class="text-block-13">The DISARM Foundation C.I.C. is a UK Community Interest Company, 15833044<br/>Newstead House, Pelham Road, Nottingham, NG5 1AP <br/></div><div id="w-node-_309aa5b8-85b4-252b-e2e4-09792ccf0c7d-2ccf0c24" class="horizontal-link-block"><a href="/privacy-policy" class="footer-link legal">Privacy Policy</a><div class="div-block-9"></div><a href="/terms-of-service" class="footer-link legal">Terms of Service</a></div></div></div></footer><script src="https://d3e54v103j8qbb.cloudfront.net/js/jquery-3.5.1.min.dc5e7f18c8.js?site=61f2ac630563985ada1eebac" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha256-9/aliU8dGd2tb6OSsuzixeV4y/faTqgFtohetphbbj0=" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61f2ac630563985ada1eebac/js/webflow.schunk.36b8fb49256177c8.js" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha384-4abIlA5/v7XaW1HMXKBgnUuhnjBYJ/Z9C1OSg4OhmVw9O3QeHJ/qJqFBERCDPv7G" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61f2ac630563985ada1eebac/js/webflow.schunk.9ea5873237d89988.js" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha384-qpUx/pACk42elJNPrDiQ0PxStMhBRCUd60KQ816Y9CAX4SAj7WhcDS01ZFzvxCMN" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/61f2ac630563985ada1eebac/js/webflow.5d43b821.9dc81d250a243a60.js" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha384-t3sIxJk0++L7YU9yyX1BAIXVG1Sz0eaLqpqwJiaMM1TXzNYosGdlI1w0gj/Ldf4q" crossorigin="anonymous"></script></body></html>